    "en": "Mebius Charts is a curated collection of 62 animated data visualization components designed for modern fintech, crypto, and SaaS dashboards. Packaged with auto-layout Figma source files and single-file React/TypeScript components styled via Tailwind CSS, each widget features smooth entrance and value transition dynamics powered by Anime.js, and installs directly into projects through the shadcn CLI registry.",
    "zh": "Mebius Charts 是一套专为金融科技、加密资产与 SaaS 仪表盘打造的高品质动效图表套件，收录 62 款涵盖收支、资产趋势与分配的可视化卡片。全套组件提供支持 Auto Layout 与变量的 Figma 原文件，以及基于 Tailwind CSS 的单文件 React/TypeScript 源码；底层由 Anime.js 驱动流畅的入场微交互与数值过渡动画，支持通过 shadcn CLI 注册表一键本地导入。"
